/**
 * T5 neighbourhood page — Briarwood, north-west Midland, Midland County.
 *
 * TWO THINGS CARRY THIS PAGE:
 *
 * 1. THE SWIMMING POOLS. The Briarwood Homeowners Association operates TWO
 *    pools and a playground, and its own records show that in early 2018 the
 *    pools required major repairs for EQUIPMENT FAILURES and code violations,
 *    funded by a three-year capital improvement assessment beginning 2019–20.
 *    That is a documented, first-party fact about pool plant failing — and a
 *    pool whose circulation stops becomes mosquito habitat within about a
 *    week. No competitor page in this market is making that connection.
 *
 * 2. A DISCREPANCY WE DO NOT RESOLVE. The city plat record shows Briarwood
 *    Section 1 recorded 1984-07-09 (Max W. Richardson, Cab D Pg 299) and the
 *    series running to a 21st section in 2012 — eighteen sections in the
 *    layer. The BWHA's own site says 259 homes and "The first homes were
 *    built in 1988." 259 homes across 18 sections is implausibly few, which
 *    suggests the association covers only PART of the platted Briarwood area.
 *    We could not confirm that. The page FLAGS it and tells the reader to
 *    check their own deed. Do not tidy this into a clean number.
 *
 * VERIFIED platting, City of Midland public ArcGIS Subdivision layer:
 *   1st 1984-07-09 Max W. Richardson Cab D Pg 299 · 2nd 1986-09-04
 *   3rd 1988-06-16 · 4th 1993-11-05 · 5th 1995-06-29 · 7th 1997-05-21
 *   8th 1998-09-16 · 11th 2001-10-24 · 10th 2002-06-05 · 12th 2003-07-01
 *   13th 2003-10-13 · 15th 2004-03-17 · 14th 2004-05-07 · 16th 2006-06-21
 *   17th 2007-01-22 · 19th 2010-11-15 · 20th 2011-09-14 · 21st 2012-11-14
 *   (Sections 6, 9 and 18 do not appear under this name. Documentary absence.)
 *
 *  - Covenants of record (Texas HOA registry management certificate for
 *    BWHA, Inc. d/b/a Briarwood Homeowners Association, subdivision
 *    "BRIARWOOD ADDITION", Midland County): Declaration of Covenants and
 *    Restrictions Vol. 1191 Pg. 1; Supplemental Vol. 1191 Pg. 28; Amended
 *    Dedication, Covenants and Restrictions Vol. 815 Pg. 152; Amended
 *    Restrictions and Covenants Vol. 1459 Pg. 528; Notice of Filing
 *    Dedicatory Instruments Doc. 2023-23964; certificate recorded as inst.
 *    2023-24370 on 11 October 2023.
 *  - Amenities: two pools and a playground. Pool access by keyed entry with a
 *    deposit. 2018 major pool repairs for equipment failures and code
 *    violations; playground mulch replaced for compliance; three-year capital
 *    improvement assessment from 2019–2020.
 *  - IDEA Henry school site: preliminary plat for 26.8621 acres at the
 *    north-east corner of Briarwood Avenue and Navasota Drive, Midland P&Z,
 *    1 March 2021, Council District 4.
 *  - Briarwood and the Greathouse Addition DIRECTLY ABUT — their plat extents
 *    meet. Greathouse Elementary is roughly 330 ft west of Briarwood's western
 *    plat boundary. (Geometry against the city's own layers; adjacency is
 *    reliable, exact distances are approximate.)
 *  - Not in mapped 100-year floodplain; no mapped playa inside the plat extent.
 *  - Midland County IS on the imported fire ant regulated-areas list.
 *
 * COVENANT LANGUAGE — HANDLE WITH CARE. A brokerage guide quotes Briarwood
 * covenant material requiring trees and shrubs to be trimmed and grass kept
 * healthy, and vehicles parked off the street overnight. That is an
 * AGGREGATOR paraphrasing the association, NOT a first-party quote, and the
 * recorded Declaration text itself was never read. So this page does NOT quote
 * it verbatim and does NOT attribute words to the association. It describes
 * the subject matter and sends the reader to the recorded volumes. Never
 * upgrade this to a quotation.
 *
 * NOT ESTABLISHED — MUST NOT BE STATED:
 *  - Acreage, lot sizes, alleys, curbs, cul-de-sacs, developer name.
 *  - Attendance zones. Greathouse Elementary is 330 ft away; proximity is not
 *    a zone assignment and Midland ISD publishes zones only via a JS tool.
 *  - Whether the IDEA Henry campus was built. A preliminary plat was
 *    considered in 2021; we do not know the outcome. Say only that.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AnswerBox from '../../../components/AnswerBox.astro';
import Trust from '../../../components/Trust.astro';
import ServiceMap from '../../../components/ServiceMap.astro';
